OL,3,AMushroom killer must stay in jail for
OL,4,A'truly dreadful' crime, prosecutors
OL,5,Atell appeal court
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis live page has now closed - you can
OL,8,Fread more in our story here
OL,10,FAn Australian court has wrapped up the
OL,11,Fsecond and last day of an appeal
OL,12,Fhearing by so-called mushroom murderer
OL,13,FErin Patterson
OL,15,FThe 51-year-old was jailed for life
OL,16,Flast year after three of her relatives
OL,17,Fwere killed and another left severely
OL,18,Funwell after eating a lunch laced with
OL,19,Fpoisonous mushrooms - here's a
OL,20,Frefresher on the trial
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
