OL,3,AMushroom killer must stay in jail for
OL,4,A'truly dreadful' crime, prosecutors
OL,5,Atell appeal court
OL,6,
OL,7,FPatterson is seeking to have her
OL,8,Fconvictions overturned - she has always
OL,9,Fmaintained the deaths were an accident
OL,10,Fand her lawyers argue she didn't
OL,11,Freceive a fair trial
OL,13,FMeanwhile, prosecutors argue that she
OL,14,Fshould stay in jail, with no chance for
OL,15,Fparole for the "truly dreadful" crime
OL,17,FAn appeal decision could take several
OL,18,Fweeks or months
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
